    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u07.d05.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Ordering a meal",
        "ru": "Заказ еды"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Book with \"I'd like to book a table\". Order with \"Can I have…?\" or \"I'll have…\". Ask for the bill with \"Could we have the bill, please?\".",
        "ru": "Бронируй: \"I'd like to book a table\". Заказывай: \"Can I have…?\" или \"I'll have…\". Счёт: \"Could we have the bill, please?\"."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "book",
            "ru": "бронь"
          },
          "formula": "I'd like to book a table for two.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "I'd like to book a table for two, please.",
              "ru": "Хочу забронировать столик на двоих."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "order",
            "ru": "заказ"
          },
          "formula": "I'll have … / Can I have …?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "I'll have the soup and the fish.",
              "ru": "Мне суп и рыбу."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "bill",
            "ru": "счёт"
          },
          "formula": "Could we have the bill, please?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Could we have the bill, please?",
              "ru": "Можно счёт, пожалуйста?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "\"I'll have\" (= I will have) is the natural way to order in a restaurant.",
          "ru": "\"I'll have\" (= I will have) — естественный способ заказать в ресторане."
        },
        {
          "en": "Say \"for a starter / for the main course\" to structure your order.",
          "ru": "Скажи \"for a starter / for the main course\", чтобы построить заказ."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u07.d05.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dinner out",
        "ru": "Ужин в ресторане"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u07.d05.reading.b1",
          "en": "On Friday we went to a restaurant for dinner. We booked a table for two near the window. The waiter brought the menu and some water.",
          "ru": "В пятницу мы пошли ужинать в ресторан. Мы забронировали столик на двоих у окна. Официант принёс меню и воду.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u07.d05.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u07.d05.reading.b2",
          "en": "For a starter I had soup, and for the main course I had fish with rice. It was delicious. At the end we asked for the bill and left a tip.",
          "ru": "На закуску я взял суп, а на основное — рыбу с рисом. Было вкусно. В конце мы попросили счёт и оставили чаевые.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u07.d05.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
